.TH DRIVERCTL-GUI 1 "2026-08-27" "driverctl-gui 0.5.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
driverctl-gui \- graphical front-end for driverctl
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B driverctl-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B driverctl-gui
is a GTK application to view PCI devices and their current driver, and to
set or clear device driver overrides using
.BR driverctl (8).
An override selects which driver binds to a device and persists across
reboots.
.PP
Privileged actions are performed through
.BR pkexec (1),
so the application itself does not run with elevated privileges.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR driverctl (8),
.BR pkexec (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Robin A. Adams
